post-it: Computer is sluggish
cause: Fragmented hard drive
symptoms:
	Slow computer
checks:
	yes: Windows starts
	yes: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: Windows starts quickly
		shows: the splash screen lasts three times as long
	no: Folders open quickly
		shows: 2 s each
software steps:
	Run Disk Defragmenter
	Leave it on until the afternoon next day
notes:
	WILL TAKE UNTIL AFTERNOON NEXT DAY
